de=\"systems\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#systems\" aria-label=\"02 / Systems\"><span>02</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">METHOD</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">LOADOUT</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">FORGE</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">SPELLBOOK</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"proof\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#proof\" aria-label=\"03 / Evidence\"><span>03</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">WORK</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">TRACE</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">TRIALS</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">ROLL</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"path\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#path\" aria-label=\"04 / Knowledge\"><span>04</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">NOTES</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">MEMORY</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">ORACLE</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">CHRONICLE</span></b></a></div><div data-cstd-theme-scene-node=\"finale\" data-cstd-theme-scene-active=\"false\"><a href=\"#cstd-footer\" aria-label=\"05 / Dispatch\"><span>05</span><b><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"atelier\">CONTACT</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"neon-district\">EXIT</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"underworld-forge\">RETURN</span><span data-cstd-theme-scene-copy=\"astral-covenant\">LEGACY</span></b></a></div></nav><div data-cstd-home-atelier=\"true\" class=\"relative z-10 bg-[#f5f5f7] text-[#1d1d1f]\"><section id=\"top\" data-cstd-scene=\"hero\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"hero\" class=\"relative flex min-h-[92svh] flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden px-6 pb-16 pt-32 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(58%_46%_at_72%_30%,rgb(255_255_255/92%),transparent_70%)]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/50\"></span>CSTD / PERSONAL STUDIO · MELBOURNE</p><h1 class=\"mt-7 text-[3.4rem] font-bold leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-[5.6rem] lg:text-[7rem]\">Custard</h1><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-2xl\">Data science postgraduate · delivering analysis, data systems, and products together</p><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#55555c] md:text-lg md:leading-9\">I am finishing a Master of Data Science at Monash; my undergraduate path at the University of Sydney moved from chemical and biomolecular engineering into data science. Whether I am wrangling 1.47 million rows of open data in R or turning an analysis into a shipped product, the working method stays the same: real questions, verifiable data, reproducible conclusions, and products that actually run. This site is not a skills list; it keeps the work, the trade-offs, and how they were checked.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1d1d1f] px-6 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03]\" href=\"#work\">See the work<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#1d1d1f]/25 px-6 text-sm font-bold text-[#1d1d1f] transition-colors hover:border-[#1d1d1f]/60\" href=\"/en/about\">About me<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-8 mx-auto flex w-fit items-center gap-2 text-[#6e6e73]\"><span class=\"h-8 w-px animate-pulse bg-[#1d1d1f]/30\"></span></div></section><section aria-label=\"Key numbers\" class=\"border-y border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1200px] grid-cols-2 gap-y-8 px-6 py-12 md:grid-cols-4 md:px-10\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">7</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">published cases</p></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">81</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">public proofs</p></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">8</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">technical notes</p></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:180ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"text-center md:text-left\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl\">100</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#6e6e73]\">content health</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"method\" data-cstd-scene=\"systems\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"method\" class=\"border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->01<!-- --> / <!-- -->Working method</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">Three steps, one finished thing</h2></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\" class=\"\"><div data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"atelier\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-atelier-method !border-x-0 !border-t-0\"><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner !w-full !max-w-none !px-0\"><div data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"atelier\" data-cstd-atelier-method=\"deconstruct\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Three working steps\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method-steps\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"deconstruct\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"true\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">01</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span><strong>Deconstruct</strong><small>Facts before plans</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"build\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">02</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg></span><strong>Build</strong><small></small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"verify\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">03</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><strong>Verify</strong><small></small></button></div><div class=\"cstd-atelier-method-detail\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Split the problem into checkable pieces: where the data lives, what the definitions are, which constraints hold.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"work\" data-cstd-scene=\"proof\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"work\" class=\"bg-white px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->02<!-- --> / <!-- -->Selected work</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">Analysis, systems, and products you can verify.</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"md:col-span-2\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-[#e8eaee] md:h-[26rem]\" href=\"/en/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><img alt=\"Weekday-by-hour heatmap of pedestrian activity across the Melbourne CBD\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 50%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-melbourne-heatmap-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(29,29,31,0.92)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 p-6 md:p-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->Open-data analysis / reproducible R pipeline</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.014em] text-white md:text-3xl\">Melbourne Pedestrians × Microclimate</h3><p class=\"mt-2 hidden max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/78 md:block\">Three official City of Melbourne open datasets, cleaned, spatially joined, and modelled into one reproducible pipeline: 1.47 million pedestrian records meet the microclimate under a 150-metre matching rule.</p></div><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#1d1d1f] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:70ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-[#e8eaee] md:h-[26rem]\" href=\"/en/work/rocodex-platform\"><img alt=\"RocoDex product interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 36%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/rocodex.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(29,29,31,0.92)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 p-6 md:p-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->Domain boundaries / content product</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.014em] text-white md:text-3xl\">RocoDex dual-site platform</h3><p class=\"mt-2 hidden max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/78 md:block\">The portfolio and RocoDex share one Next.js deployment while hosts, auth, content modules, and regression suites remain separately owned.</p></div><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#1d1d1f] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:140ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[22rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-[#e8eaee] md:h-[26rem]\" href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\"><img alt=\"CSTD Alpha research interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.035]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 24%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0)_0%,rgba(29,29,31,0.92)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between gap-4 p-6 md:p-8\"><div><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-white/70\">2026<!-- --> · <!-- -->Evidence pipeline / decision workspace</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.014em] text-white md:text-3xl\">CSTD Alpha research system</h3><p class=\"mt-2 hidden max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/78 md:block\">A research workflow instead of a one-shot report: sources, background jobs, valuation versions, and disconfirming conditions stay with each result.</p></div><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#1d1d1f] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:rotate-45\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></span></div></a></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#0066cc] transition-colors hover:text-[#1d1d1f]\" href=\"/en/work\">Enter the work archive<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section data-cstd-atelier-section=\"data\" class=\"border-y border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1200px] items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> <!-- -->DATA ANALYSIS / OPEN DATA</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-[2.6rem]\">1.47 million rows of open data, one rerunnable pipeline.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-[#55555c]\">Cleaning, spatially joining, and modelling pedestrian counts, sensor locations, and microclimate from the City of Melbourne: temperature, PM2.5, and wind stay associated with activity after controls, and vulnerability shifts by place, weekday, and weekend.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1d1d1f] px-6 text-sm font-bold text-white transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-[1.03]\" href=\"/en/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\">Read the analysis<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">R · data.table · ggplot2 · lm</span></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:100ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group relative block h-[24rem] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/8 bg-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgb(0_0_0/4%),0_24px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/10%)] md:h-[28rem]\" href=\"/en/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><img alt=\"Weekday-by-hour heatmap of Melbourne CBD pedestrian activity\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.03]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-archive/cstd-archive-melbourne-heatmap-v1.webp\"/><span class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 rounded-full bg-white/92 px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#1d1d1f]\">Weekday × hour heatmap</span></a></div></div></section><section id=\"notes\" data-cstd-scene=\"path\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"notes\" class=\"bg-white px-6 py-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->03<!-- --> / <!-- -->Technical notes</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">Write the judgement down. Keep it checkable.</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 border-t border-[#1d1d1f]/10\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 py-7 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f7]\" href=\"/en/notes/host-boundaries-in-one-next-deployment\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">2026-08</span><span><span class=\"block text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-xl\">One Next.js deployment, two genuinely separate websites</span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73]\">How one repository and one deployment can still keep custard.top and RocoDex as genuinely separate products.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 py-7 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f7]\" href=\"/en/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">2026-08</span><span><span class=\"block text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-xl\">Refresh evidence before asking the model to speak</span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73]\">In company research, stale facts, duplicate jobs, and conclusions without a clear source usually cost more than tokens.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-baseline gap-5 border-b border-[#1d1d1f]/10 py-7 transition-colors hover:bg-[#f5f5f7]\" href=\"/en/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-bold text-[#6e6e73]\">2026-08</span><span><span class=\"block text-lg font-bold tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-xl\">Put AI at the explanation edge, not the decision core</span><span class=\"mt-1.5 block max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#6e6e73]\">Let AI organize and explain while testable code keeps authority over valuation formulas, cash flow, discounting, and versions.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-bold text-[#0066cc] transition-colors hover:text-[#1d1d1f]\" href=\"/en/notes\">Enter the notes archive<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] px-6 py-20 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[1200px] flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Executable labs</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.018em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-3xl\">Conclusions do not run on words. They run on experiments.</h2></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#1d1d1f]/25 px-6 text-sm font-bold text-[#1d1d1f] transition-colors hover:border-[#1d1d1f]/60\" href=\"/en/lab\">Enter the labs<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" data-cstd-scene=\"finale\" data-cstd-atelier-section=\"contact\" class=\"bg-white px-6 pb-28 pt-24 md:px-10 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px]\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#6e6e73]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#1d1d1f]/40\"></span> <!-- -->04<!-- --> / <!-- -->Open contact</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.024em] text-[#1d1d1f] md:text-5xl lg:text-[3.6rem]\">If you are looking for someone who ships analysis as products.</h2></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:80ms\" class=\"\"><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#0066cc]/40 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_rgb(0_0_0/8%)]\" href=\"/en/about\"><div><h3 class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xl font-bold text-[#1d1d1f]\">About<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#55555c]\">The engineering path, principles, and capability surface.</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text mt-8 h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:60ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#0066cc]/40 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_rgb(0_0_0/8%)]\" href=\"/en/now\"><div><h3 class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xl font-bold text-[#1d1d1f]\">Now<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#55555c]\">What is being built and learned right now.</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text mt-8 h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></a></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:120ms\" class=\"\"><a class=\"group flex h-full flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-[#1d1d1f]/10 bg-[#f5f5f7] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[#0066cc]/40 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_rgb(0_0_0/8%)]\" href=\"/en/resume\"><div><h3 class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xl font-bold text-[#1d1d1f]\">Résumé<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73] transition-all duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-[#0066cc]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#55555c]\">The machine-readable, printable record.</p></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text mt-8 h-4 w-4 text-[#6e6e73]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div data-cstd-atelier-reveal=\"hidden\" style=\"transition-delay:140ms\" class=\"\"><p class=\"mt-14 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#6e6e73]\">The site itself is the most complete work: a bilingual content pipeline, reproducible analysis, four visual worlds, and automated verification in one Next.js deployment.</p></div></div></section></div><div data-cstd-home-game=\"true\" class=\"contents\"><section id=\"top\" data-cstd-hero=\"true\" data-cstd-chapter=\"hero\" data-cstd-scene=\"hero\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-hero-title\" class=\"cstd-hero-stage relative z-10 flex min-h-svh items-center overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 px-5 pb-14 pt-28 md:px-10 lg:min-h-[104svh] lg:px-16 lg:pb-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-stage-visual=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"cstd-stage-visual-image absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-stage-visual-wash=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0\"></div><div data-cstd-stage-visual-focus=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0\"></div></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-motion-layer=\"ambient\" class=\"absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[74%] bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98),rgba(5,7,9,0.84)_60%,transparent)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-40 bg-[linear-gradient(0deg,#050709,transparent)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-motion-layer=\"narrative\" class=\"cstd-hero-scanline absolute inset-x-0 top-[24%] h-px bg-[#24e0ff]/35\"></div><div data-cstd-hero-layout=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1320px] gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(19rem,25rem)] lg:items-end lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"cstd-hero-copy max-w-[50rem]\" data-cstd-motion-layer=\"narrative\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431] md:text-xs\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-px w-10 bg-[#f4d431]\"></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">CSTD / PERSONAL STUDIO</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">CSTD / PERSONAL STUDIO</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">UNDERWORLD ARCHIVE / MAKER 017</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">ASTRAL JOURNAL / ADVENTURER 017</span></p><h1 id=\"cstd-hero-title\" aria-label=\"Custard\" data-text=\"Custard\" class=\"cstd-hero-wordmark mt-7 w-fit text-[4.35rem] font-black leading-[0.86] text-[#f2efe7] md:text-[6.5rem] lg:text-[7.75rem]\">Custard</h1><p data-cstd-hero-role=\"true\" class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-sm font-black leading-tight text-[#24e0ff] md:text-lg\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">DATA SCIENCE POSTGRADUATE · ANALYSIS, SYSTEMS, PRODUCTS</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">DATA SCIENCE POSTGRADUATE / ANALYSIS THAT SHIPS</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">DATA SCIENCE POSTGRADUATE / ANALYSIS ARTIFICER</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">DATA SCIENCE POSTGRADUATE / ANALYSIS TACTICIAN</span></p><p data-cstd-hero-thesis=\"true\" data-cstd-narrative-thesis=\"Put sources, definitions, and uncertainty on the table first.\" class=\"mt-10 max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-[1.08] text-[#f2efe7] md:text-[2.8rem] lg:text-[3.1rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">Take the problem apart,<span class=\"block\">make the answer hold up.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">I take problems apart<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">until they work in the real world.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Difficult systems are forged<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">through trial and return.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">Complex systems are adventures<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">written by choices.</span></span></p><p data-cstd-hero-description=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-[#aeb8bb] md:text-lg md:leading-8\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">I run reproducible analysis in R, Python, and SQL, then ship it as products that actually run. This site keeps the work, the trade-offs, and the verification.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">I build analysis and the systems behind it. Data, interfaces, AI, and release all have to survive real use, not just a polished demo.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">I bring analysis, AI, data, and release into one workshop: shape the method, put it through trial, then return it to the real world with evidence intact.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">I spread questions, data, code, and release across one campaign table: read the situation, assemble the tools, choose a route, and keep the evidence for what comes next.</span></p><div data-cstd-hero-actions=\"true\" class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3\"><a href=\"#systems\" class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 bg-[#f4d431] px-5 font-mono text-sm font-black text-[#050709] [clip-path:polygon(0_0,100%_0,100%_70%,calc(100%-14px)_100%,0_100%)] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\">Enter the systems field<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-2 border-b border-[#24e0ff]/55 px-1 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#c9f8ff] transition-colors hover:border-white hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\" href=\"/en/about\">Meet Custard<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div data-cstd-motion-layer=\"interactive\" class=\"lg:pb-1\"><aside data-cstd-entry-console=\"true\" data-cstd-entry-ready=\"false\" aria-label=\"Homepage viewing depth\"><div data-cstd-entry-status=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[10px] font-black\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">STUDIO LINK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">STUDIO LINK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">ENTER THE FORGE</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">OPEN ADVENTURE LOG</span></p><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[9px] font-black\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>LINKING STUDIO</span></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-cstd-boot-track=\"true\" class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2\"><span data-cstd-boot-step=\"identity\" data-cstd-boot-step-ready=\"false\"></span><span data-cstd-boot-step=\"systems\" data-cstd-boot-step-ready=\"false\"></span><span data-cstd-boot-step=\"proof\" data-cstd-boot-step-ready=\"false\"></span></div><span class=\"sr-only\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose viewing depth\" data-cstd-depth-tabs=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-3\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-depth-signal\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"cstd-depth-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-depth-active=\"true\">10 SEC</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-depth-tour\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"cstd-depth-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-depth-active=\"false\">1 MIN</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"cstd-depth-archive\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"cstd-depth-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-depth-active=\"false\">5 MIN</button></div><div id=\"cstd-depth-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-depth-signal\" data-cstd-depth-panel=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 min-h-36\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock3 lucide-clock-3 h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6h4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->10 SEC</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-xl font-semibold leading-tight\">See the outcome</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6\">Three selected systems, clear ownership, and live destinations you can verify.</p><a href=\"#proof\" data-cstd-depth-action=\"true\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\">Jump to work and evidence<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></a></div></aside></div><dl data-cstd-hero-summary=\"true\" class=\"grid max-w-[46rem] border-t border-white/14 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-3.5 last:border-b-0 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0 sm:last:border-r-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">01</dt><dd class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#aeb8bb]\">Data analysis</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-3.5 last:border-b-0 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0 sm:last:border-r-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">02</dt><dd class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#aeb8bb]\">Data systems and products</dd></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 border-b border-white/10 py-3.5 last:border-b-0 sm:border-b-0 sm:border-r sm:px-5 sm:first:pl-0 sm:last:border-r-0\"><dt class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">03</dt><dd class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-[#aeb8bb]\">Release and verification</dd></div></dl></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 hidden items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#697478] md:flex lg:right-16\"><span class=\"h-px w-14 bg-[#24e0ff]/55\"></span>NEXT / 02 CAPABILITY SYSTEM</div></section><div data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"atelier\" data-cstd-atelier-method=\"deconstruct\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Three working steps\" class=\"cstd-atelier-method-steps\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"deconstruct\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"true\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">01</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></span><strong>Deconstruct</strong><small>Facts before plans</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"build\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">02</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg></span><strong>Build</strong><small></small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-cstd-atelier-step=\"verify\" data-cstd-atelier-step-active=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-number\">03</span><span class=\"cstd-atelier-method-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span><strong>Verify</strong><small></small></button></div><div class=\"cstd-atelier-method-detail\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Split the problem into checkable pieces: where the data lives, what the definitions are, which constraints hold.</p></div></div><section data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"neon-district\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-neon-breach-title\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-neon-breach\"><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner\"><header class=\"cstd-neon-breach-header\"><div><p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg> CSTD://BREACH_SEQUENCE</p><h2 id=\"cstd-neon-breach-title\">Breach my working method.</h2></div><div data-cstd-neon-breach-status=\"scanning\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio-tower\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 16.1C1 12.2 1 5.8 4.9 1.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 4.7a6.14 6.14 0 0 0-.8 7.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 4.8c2 2 2.26 5.11.8 7.47\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 1.9a9.96 9.96 0 0 1 0 14.1\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 18h5\"></path><path d=\"m8 22 4-11 4 11\"></path></svg><span>00 / 03</span></div></header><div class=\"cstd-neon-breach-line\" style=\"--cstd-breach-progress:0\"><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node=\"1\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node-state=\"active\"><span>01</span><strong>LOCATE</strong><small>Scan the real problem</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node=\"2\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node-state=\"locked\" disabled=\"\"><span>02</span><strong>DECRYPT</strong><small>Read the constraints</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node=\"3\" data-cstd-neon-breach-node-state=\"locked\" disabled=\"\"><span>03</span><strong>EXTRACT</strong><small>Ship verifiable proof</small></button></div><footer class=\"cstd-neon-breach-footer\"><span>BREACH THE NODES IN SEQUENCE</span><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset breach sequence\" title=\"Reset\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg></button></footer></div></section><section data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"underworld-forge\" data-cstd-boon-selected=\"none\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-underworld-boon-title\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-underworld-boon\"><div class=\"cstd-underworld-slash\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner\"><header class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-header\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4\"></path></svg></span><div><p>BEFORE THE STYX / CHOOSE A BOON</p><h2 id=\"cstd-underworld-boon-title\">Every delivery begins with an intent.</h2></div></header><div class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-grid\"><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-underworld-boon=\"edge\" data-cstd-underworld-boon-active=\"false\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-number\">01</span><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-sigil\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sword\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m11 19-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m5 21-2-2\"></path><path d=\"m8 16-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 17.5 20.414 6.586A2 2 0 0021 5.172V3h-2.172a2 2 0 00-1.414.586L6.5 14.5\"></path></svg></span><strong>BOON OF EDGE</strong><small>Cut the false premise</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-underworld-boon=\"insight\" data-cstd-underworld-boon-active=\"false\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-number\">02</span><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-sigil\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><strong>BOON OF SIGHT</strong><small>Reveal the cost</small></button><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-underworld-boon=\"resolve\" data-cstd-underworld-boon-active=\"false\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-number\">03</span><span class=\"cstd-underworld-boon-sigil\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></span><strong>BOON OF RESOLVE</strong><small>Return with the system whole</small></button></div><p data-cstd-underworld-boon-result=\"true\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>The flame awaits your choice.</p></div></section><section data-cstd-theme-encounter=\"true\" data-cstd-theme-encounter-theme=\"astral-covenant\" data-cstd-astral-rolling=\"false\" aria-labelledby=\"cstd-astral-roll-title\" class=\"cstd-theme-encounter cstd-astral-roll\"><div class=\"cstd-astral-route-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"cstd-encounter-inner\"><header class=\"cstd-astral-roll-header\"><p><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scroll-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 12h-5\"></path><path d=\"M15 8h-5\"></path><path d=\"M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4\"></path><path d=\"M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3\"></path></svg> <!-- -->ASTRAL JOURNAL / ABILITY CHECK</p><h2 id=\"cstd-astral-roll-title\">Choose an approach. Put the decision to fate.</h2></header><div class=\"cstd-astral-roll-table\"><div class=\"cstd-astral-approaches\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Choose an ability\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-cstd-astral-approach=\"craft\" data-cstd-astral-approach-active=\"true\"><span>CRAFT</span><strong>+<!-- -->2</strong><small>Turn intent into systems</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-cstd-astral-approach=\"lore\" data-cstd-astral-approach-active=\"false\"><span>LORE</span><strong>+<!-- -->4</strong><small>Use research to shorten detours</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"radio\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-cstd-astral-approach=\"party\" data-cstd-astral-approach-active=\"false\"><span>PARTY</span><strong>+<!-- -->3</strong><small>Let different strengths travel together</small></button></div><button type=\"button\" data-cstd-astral-roll=\"true\" aria-label=\"Roll the twenty-sided die\" class=\"cstd-astral-d20-button\"><span class=\"cstd-astral-d20-face\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-dices\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" x=\"2\" y=\"10\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m17.92 14 3.5-3.5a2.24 2.24 0 0 0 0-3l-5-4.92a2.24 2.24 0 0 0-3 0L10 6\"></path><path d=\"M6 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M15 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h.01\"></path></svg><strong>D20</strong></span><small>ROLL</small></button><div data-cstd-astral-roll-result=\"true\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"cstd-astral-roll-result\"><span>JOURNAL ENTRY</span><strong>+2</strong><p>Choose an approach, then let the die answer.</p></div></div></div></section><div id=\"systems\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-scene-shell=\"systems\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-16 focus:outline-none\"><section data-cstd-chapter=\"systems\" data-cstd-scene=\"systems\" data-cstd-studio-twin=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"studio-twin-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 overflow-hidden border-y border-white/10 bg-[#07090b] px-5 py-20 text-[#f2efe7] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><img alt=\"Five capability districts connected to the core of Custard&#x27;s personal studio\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[64%_50%] opacity-15\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-core-world-v4.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.99),rgba(5,7,9,0.93)_56%,rgba(5,7,9,0.8))]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><header data-cstd-chapter-header=\"true\" class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2\"></path></svg><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">02 / CAPABILITY SYSTEM</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">02 / CAPABILITY SYSTEM</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">HALL II / SYSTEMS FORGE</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">CHAPTER II / PARTY &amp; SPELLBOOK</span></p><h2 id=\"studio-twin-heading\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">I do not collect skill badges.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">I build systems that ship.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">I do not collect skill badges.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">I build systems that ship.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Capability is not a badge.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">It is a tool tempered through use.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">Capability is not a spell slot.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">It is what the party can rely on.</span></span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-[#aeb8bb]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">Product, AI, data, and release are different sides of the same job. Open a district to see what it carried in a real project.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">Product, AI, data, and release are different sides of the same job. Open a district to see what it carried in a real project.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Five capability chains, five sets of tools. Open one to see how it shapes a system, survives trial, and leaves a mark on real work.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">Five capability chains form one party. Each has a specialty, but they still have to carry the same adventure. Open one to see where it changed a real project&#x27;s route.</span></p></div><a data-cstd-observatory-deployment=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/Muguett-DBY/RocoDex/tree/main\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"group flex min-w-56 items-center gap-4 border-y border-white/12 py-4 font-mono transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff]/50\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-commit-horizontal h-4 w-4 text-[#24e0ff]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circl