order border-white/12 md:min-h-[24rem]\" data-cstd-system-visual=\"research-models\"><img alt=\"A research observatory formed by probability surfaces and experiment traces\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"cstd-district-backdrop object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-districts/research-models-v1.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.96),rgba(5,7,9,0.08)_72%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-6 md:p-8\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black\" style=\"color:#3dff8f\">QUANTITATIVE RESEARCH</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold md:text-5xl\">Research and interpretable models</h3></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-8 border-b border-white/12 py-7 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto] md:items-end\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <!-- -->EVIDENCE LINKED</div><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-[#c3cacc]\">Support decisions with explicit assumptions, statistical models, valuation, and interpretable charts.</p><p class=\"mt-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold leading-5 text-[#7f8b90]\">Python / R Shiny / Jupyter / Plotly / NumPy / pandas</p></div><dl class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:min-w-[19rem]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><dt data-cstd-system-metric-label=\"true\" class=\"order-2 mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#697478]\">COVERAGE</dt><dd class=\"order-1 font-mono text-xl font-black text-white\">77%</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><dt data-cstd-system-metric-label=\"true\" class=\"order-2 mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#697478]\">ARTIFACTS</dt><dd class=\"order-1 font-mono text-xl font-black text-white\">14</dd></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><dt data-cstd-system-metric-label=\"true\" class=\"order-2 mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#697478]\">SYSTEMS</dt><dd class=\"order-1 font-mono text-xl font-black text-white\">3</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/observatory.json\">RELEASE <!-- -->CSTD-17.0<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[#899499] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/map\">KNOWLEDGE MAP<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section></div><div id=\"proof\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-scene-shell=\"proof\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-16 focus:outline-none\"><section data-cstd-chapter=\"proof\" data-cstd-scene=\"proof\" data-cstd-proof-reel=\"true\" data-cstd-light-chapter=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"proof-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 border-b border-black/15 bg-[#f0efe9] px-5 py-20 text-[#090b0d] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><header data-cstd-chapter-header=\"true\" class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_24rem] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#005f70]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio-tower h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 16.1C1 12.2 1 5.8 4.9 1.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 4.7a6.14 6.14 0 0 0-.8 7.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 4.8c2 2 2.26 5.11.8 7.47\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 1.9a9.96 9.96 0 0 1 0 14.1\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 18h5\"></path><path d=\"m8 22 4-11 4 11\"></path></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">03 / SELECTED WORK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">03 / SELECTED WORK</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">HALL III / WORKS FORGED</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">CHAPTER III / JOURNEYS TAKEN</span></p><h2 id=\"proof-heading\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">Three systems.<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">Three inspectable chains of evidence.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">Three systems.<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">Three inspectable chains of evidence.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Three works leave the forge.<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">Each carries the mark of its trials.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">Three journeys already travelled.<span class=\"block text-[#007e92]\">Each carries its choices and consequences.</span></span></h2></div><p class=\"border-l border-black/20 pl-6 text-sm leading-7 text-[#465156] md:text-base md:leading-8\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">The homepage starts with outcomes: what shipped, why it was shaped that way, and where it runs now. The full teardown lives in the case archive.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">The homepage starts with outcomes: what shipped, why it was shaped that way, and where it runs now. The full teardown lives in the case archive.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Nothing leaves this forge untested. Each work keeps its outcome, decisive trade-off, and an inspectable record of how it was made.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">These are not tales of inevitable victory. Each journey keeps the situation, the choice that was actually made, and the outcome you can still verify.</span></p></header><div data-cstd-proof-grid=\"true\" class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:auto-rows-[15.5rem]\"><article data-cstd-proof=\"alpha\" class=\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-7 lg:row-span-2 lg:min-h-0\"><img alt=\"CSTD Alpha research interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 24%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.03)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.3)_46%,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_82%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->1<!-- --> / <!-- -->EVIDENCE PIPELINE / DECISION WORKSPACE</span><span class=\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->80<!-- -->%</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl\">CSTD Alpha research system</h3><p class=\"mt-3 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b5bdc0]\">A research workflow instead of a one-shot report: sources, background jobs, valuation versions, and disconfirming conditions stay with each result.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-4 mt-5\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] hover:gap-4 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://alpha.custard.top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Open CSTD Alpha research system\" title=\"Open CSTD Alpha research system\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#aab3b6] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#24e0ff] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article data-cstd-proof=\"rocodex\" class=\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-5 lg:min-h-0\"><img alt=\"RocoDex product interface\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 36%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/rocodex.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.72)_56%,rgba(5,7,9,0.12)_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7 lg:right-auto lg:max-w-[75%]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->2<!-- --> / <!-- -->DOMAIN BOUNDARIES / CONTENT PRODUCT</span><span class=\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] hidden lg:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->100<!-- -->%</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl\">RocoDex dual-site platform</h3><p class=\"mt-3 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b5bdc0] lg:hidden\">The portfolio and RocoDex share one Next.js deployment while hosts, auth, content modules, and regression suites remain separately owned.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-4 mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] hover:gap-4 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/work/rocodex-platform\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://rocodex.custard.top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Open RocoDex dual-site platform\" title=\"Open RocoDex dual-site platform\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#aab3b6] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#24e0ff] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article><article data-cstd-proof=\"crm\" class=\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-5 lg:min-h-0\"><img alt=\"CFZZS CRM dashboard\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:scale-[1.04]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:50% 26%;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-projects/crm.png\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.72)_56%,rgba(5,7,9,0.12)_100%)]\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7 lg:right-auto lg:max-w-[75%]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->3<!-- --> / <!-- -->OPERATIONS / PERMISSIONS AND CONCURRENCY</span><span class=\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] hidden lg:flex\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> <!-- -->80<!-- -->%</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl\">CFZZS industrial CRM</h3><p class=\"mt-3 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[#b5bdc0] lg:hidden\">A lead workbench for an industrial-park team, keeping deduplication, stage changes, spatial inventory, and exports tied to traceable state.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t border-white/15 pt-4 mt-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-black text-[#f4d431] transition-[gap,color] hover:gap-4 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\" href=\"/en/work/cfzzs-crm\">Open case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://cfzzs.custard.top\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Open CFZZS industrial CRM\" title=\"Open CFZZS industrial CRM\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#aab3b6] transition-colors hover:border-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#24e0ff] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></article></div><section data-cstd-evidence-chain=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"evidence-chain-heading\" class=\"mt-14\"><header data-cstd-evidence-chain-header=\"true\" class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-6\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-black\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 6a9 9 0 0 0-9 9V3\"></path><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">TRACE / DECISION CHAIN</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">TRACE / DECISION CHAIN</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">TRIAL MAP / CAUSE TO PROOF</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">ADVENTURE LOG / CHOICE &amp; CONSEQUENCE</span></p><h3 id=\"evidence-chain-heading\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold md:text-4xl\">Do not stop at the outcome. Follow the decisions.</h3></div><p class=\"max-w-md text-sm leading-6\">Choose a project, then inspect its problem, decision, system, and verification. Every step is projected from the case and proof manifest.</p></header><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose a project evidence chain\" data-cstd-evidence-project-tabs=\"true\" class=\"mt-7 grid md:grid-cols-3\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-project-alpha\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"evidence-chain-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-evidence-project-active=\"true\"><span>0<!-- -->1</span><strong>CSTD Alpha research system</strong><small>80<!-- -->% / <!-- -->5<!-- --> <!-- -->artifacts</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-project-rocodex\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-chain-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-project-active=\"false\"><span>0<!-- -->2</span><strong>RocoDex dual-site platform</strong><small>100<!-- -->% / <!-- -->7<!-- --> <!-- -->artifacts</small></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-project-crm\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-chain-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-project-active=\"false\"><span>0<!-- -->3</span><strong>CFZZS industrial CRM</strong><small>80<!-- -->% / <!-- -->3<!-- --> <!-- -->artifacts</small></button></div><div id=\"evidence-chain-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"evidence-project-alpha\" data-cstd-evidence-panel=\"true\" class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[15rem_minmax(0,1fr)]\"><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose an evidence phase\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-tabs=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-alpha-problem\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"0\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"true\"><span>01</span><strong>Problem</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-alpha-decision\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"false\"><span>02</span><strong>Decision</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-alpha-system\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"false\"><span>03</span><strong>System</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"evidence-phase-alpha-verification\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"evidence-phase-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-active=\"false\"><span>04</span><strong>Verification</strong><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div><article id=\"evidence-phase-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"evidence-phase-alpha-problem\" data-cstd-evidence-phase-panel=\"true\"><p data-cstd-evidence-signal=\"true\">Answer length is not a quality metric</p><h4>Fluent answers are not reliable research</h4><p>Text without source age, job state, or disconfirming conditions cannot support durable decisions.</p><div data-cstd-evidence-meta=\"true\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Proof coverage<!-- --> <!-- -->80<!-- -->%</span><span>Last verified<!-- --> <!-- -->2026-08-09</span></div><div data-cstd-evidence-actions=\"true\"><a href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\">Read the complete case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://alpha.custard.top\">Open the live system<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></article></div></section><div data-cstd-proof-footer=\"true\" class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-5 border-t pt-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><span>7<!-- --> <!-- -->PUBLISHED CASES<!-- --> / <!-- -->31<!-- --> <!-- -->PUBLIC ARTIFACTS</span><div class=\"flex gap-6\"><a data-cstd-proof-footer-link=\"primary\" href=\"/en/work\">ALL CASES</a><a data-cstd-proof-footer-link=\"secondary\" href=\"/en/proof.json\">PROOF.JSON</a></div></div></div></section><section data-cstd-chapter=\"operator\" data-cstd-evidence-subchapter=\"true\" data-cstd-executable-evidence=\"true\" data-cstd-home-replay=\"alpha-race\" aria-labelledby=\"executable-evidence-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 border-b border-white/10 bg-[#050709] px-5 py-20 text-[#f2efe7] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><span id=\"operator\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-px w-px scroll-mt-20\"></span><div data-cstd-evidence-layout=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1320px] gap-10 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(25rem,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] xl:items-start xl:gap-16\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">03B / EXECUTABLE EVIDENCE</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">03B / EXECUTABLE EVIDENCE</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">TRIAL CHAMBER / EXECUTABLE PROOF</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">FATE CHECK / EXECUTABLE PROOF</span></p><h2 id=\"executable-evidence-heading\" class=\"mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl xl:text-[3.75rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">A case is not only readable.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">It can be executed.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">A case is not only readable.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">It can be executed.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Do not turn the result into legend.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">The run is the testimony.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">A result cannot live on hearsay.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">Make the roll and test it yourself.</span></span></h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-8 text-[#aeb7ba]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">No screen recording standing in for the work. Inputs, computation, and outcome are exposed so you can trigger the boundary yourself.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">No screen recording standing in for the work. Inputs, computation, and outcome are exposed so you can trigger the boundary yourself.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">Every system enters the trial chamber. Change a condition, light the forge again, and see which conclusion emerges intact.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">Every conclusion has to face a check. Change the conditions, run it again, and see whether success came from luck or from the system itself.</span></p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-6\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\">Read the complete technical case<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#899499] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/lab/proof-museum\">Proof museum<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div data-cstd-case-replay=\"alpha-race\" data-cstd-worker=\"dedicated\" data-cstd-worker-ready=\"false\" class=\"border border-white/15 bg-[#07090b]/92 p-5 md:p-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-6\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg> <!-- -->DEDICATED WEB WORKER</p><h3 class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-white md:text-3xl\">Async version race</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#aab3b6]\">A stale task may finish, but it cannot overwrite newer truth.</p></div><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 bg-[#f4d431] px-4 font-mono text-xs font-black text-black hover:bg-[#24e0ff] disabled:cursor-wait disabled:bg-[#485054] disabled:text-[#d7dfdc] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-[#f4d431]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Run replay</button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reset\" title=\"Reset\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/20 text-[#9aa4a8] hover:border-white hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-3 focus-visible:outline-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg></button></div></div><label class=\"mt-7 block font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#7b878c]\" for=\"replay-alpha-race-input\">Concurrent research jobs<!-- --> / <span class=\"text-[#f4d431]\">4<!-- --> jobs</span></label><input id=\"replay-alpha-race-input\" type=\"range\" min=\"2\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" class=\"mt-3 h-1 w-full accent-[#f4d431]\" value=\"4\"/><div class=\"mt-7 flex items-center gap-3 border-y border-white/10 py-5 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#9aa6aa]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg> INPUT READY / WORKER IDLE</div></div></div></section></div><div id=\"path\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-cstd-scene-shell=\"path\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-16 focus:outline-none\"><section data-cstd-chapter=\"path\" data-cstd-scene=\"path\" data-cstd-knowledge-lens=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"knowledge-lens-heading\" class=\"relative z-20 overflow-hidden border-b border-white/10 bg-[#07090b] px-5 py-20 text-[#f2efe7] md:px-10 lg:px-16 lg:py-28\"><img alt=\"Engineering notes connected into a knowledge network through citations\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover object-[62%_50%] opacity-12\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/cstd-universe/cstd-knowledge-loom-v3.webp\"/><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.99),rgba(5,7,9,0.94)_58%,rgba(5,7,9,0.82))]\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1320px]\"><header data-cstd-chapter-header=\"true\" class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_24rem] lg:items-end\"><div><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain-circuit h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M9 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3-4\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M12 13h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h6a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h8\"></path><path d=\"M16 8V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"13\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"3\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\".5\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"8\" r=\".5\"></circle></svg> <span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">04 / TECH NOTES</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">04 / TECH NOTES</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">ORACLE HALL / TECH NOTES</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">CHAPTER IV / TRAVEL CHRONICLE</span></p><h2 id=\"knowledge-lens-heading\" class=\"mt-5 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1] md:text-6xl lg:text-[4rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">Technical writing without a jargon wall.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">Only decisions tested in practice.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">Technical writing without a jargon wall.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">Only decisions tested in practice.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">An oracle does not decide for you.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">It leaves a trail you can follow.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">A map will not choose for you.<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">It records every road already taken.</span></span></h2></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-[#aeb8bb] md:text-base md:leading-8\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">Start with the question. The answer, its evidence, and the next step stay in view instead of making readers guess the context.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">Start with the question. The answer, its evidence, and the next step stay in view instead of making readers guess the context.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">These notes predict nothing. They record how a problem was opened, where the evidence came from, and where the next fire should be aimed.</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">These notes are maps opened on the road. They mark the fork, the cost, and the route left untaken so the next journey does not begin lost.</span></p></header><div data-cstd-knowledge-list=\"true\" class=\"mt-12 border-t border-white/14\"><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->1</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">How do you isolate two sites in one deployment?</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">How one repository and one deployment can still keep custard.top and RocoDex as genuinely separate products. Reliable architecture first answers who owns the request, state, and failure. Trace how boundaries ship through dual-host routing, API contracts, and operational optimistic locks. The portfolio and RocoDex share one Next.js deployment while hosts, auth, content modules, and regression suites remain separately owned.</p><a aria-label=\"Read source\" title=\"How do you isolate two sites in one deployment? / 3 linked nodes\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/en/notes/host-boundaries-in-one-next-deployment\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->2</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">How does AI research avoid hallucinated evidence?</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">Let AI organize and explain while testable code keeps authority over valuation formulas, cash flow, discounting, and versions. Models synthesize; evidence, versions, and deterministic cores constrain. Connect research agents, asynchronous jobs, citations, and stale-write protection into one auditable path. Replay an evidence-first research job across collection, fingerprinting, queueing, synthesis, and publication. A stale job may finish, but it cannot overwrite current truth.</p><a aria-label=\"Read source\" title=\"How does AI research avoid hallucinated evidence? / 3 linked nodes\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/en/notes/deterministic-core-ai-edge\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->3</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">Why does the DCF engine avoid model-generated calculations?</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">Constrain model capability inside traceable, recoverable, and reviewable product workflows. Evidence: The private AI workbench and Alpha research system are independently deployed. A performance postmortem from a DCF scan: the hot path was repeated cache JSON handling, not the formula. A local three-scenario DCF screener that keeps data definitions, caching, run manifests, and Windows delivery in one research flow.</p><a aria-label=\"Read source\" title=\"Why does the DCF engine avoid model-generated calculations? / 3 linked nodes\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article><article data-cstd-knowledge-card=\"true\" class=\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\"><span class=\"sr-only\">SOURCE LINKED</span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\">0<!-- -->4</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\">How do 1.47 million rows of open data become analysable?</h3><p class=\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\">Three official City of Melbourne open datasets, cleaned, spatially joined, and modelled into one reproducible pipeline: 1.47 million pedestrian records meet the microclimate under a 150-metre matching rule. The FIT5147 exploration project: wrangling, spatially joining, and modelling Melbourne CBD pedestrian and microclimate data into a rerunnable pipeline.</p><a aria-label=\"Read source\" title=\"How do 1.47 million rows of open data become analysable? / 2 linked nodes\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\" href=\"/en/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></article></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-cstd-content-health=\"true\" data-cstd-content-health-score=\"100\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#7f8b90]\">CONTENT HEALTH / <span class=\"text-white\">100</span></span><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-6 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\"><a class=\"text-[#f4d431] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/notes\">ALL NOTES</a><a class=\"text-[#aeb8bb] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/map\">KNOWLEDGE MAP</a><a class=\"text-[#24e0ff] hover:text-white\" href=\"/en/graph.json\">GRAPH.JSON</a></div></div></div></section></div><footer id=\"cstd-footer\" data-cstd-finale=\"true\" data-cstd-scene=\"finale\" data-cstd-generated-visual=\"departure-city-v1\" class=\"relative z-20 min-h-[76svh] border-t border-[#f4d431]/30 text-[#f2efe7]\"><div class=\"relative flex min-h-[76svh] items-end overflow-hidden px-5 pb-12 pt-28 md:px-10 md:pb-16 lg:px-16\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.8)_48%,rgba(5,7,9,0.22)_88%)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(0deg,#050709_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.28)_38%,transparent_76%)]\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-[#f4d431]/60\"></div><div data-cstd-finale-layout=\"true\" class=\"relative mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1320px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_21rem] lg:items-end lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black uppercase text-[#24e0ff]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-radio-tower h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4.9 16.1C1 12.2 1 5.8 4.9 1.9\"></path><path d=\"M7.8 4.7a6.14 6.14 0 0 0-.8 7.5\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M16.2 4.8c2 2 2.26 5.11.8 7.47\"></path><path d=\"M19.1 1.9a9.96 9.96 0 0 1 0 14.1\"></path><path d=\"M9.5 18h5\"></path><path d=\"m8 22 4-11 4 11\"></path></svg><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">05 / FINAL TRANSMISSION</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">05 / FINAL TRANSMISSION</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">FINAL CANTO / RETURN</span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"astral\">FINAL CHAPTER / CAMPFIRE LIT</span></p><h2 class=\"cstd-finale-title mt-8 text-5xl font-black leading-[0.9] tracking-[0] md:text-7xl lg:text-[6.5rem]\"><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"atelier\">STILL<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">BUILDING.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"neon\">STILL<span class=\"block text-[#f4d431]\">BUILDING.</span></span><span data-cstd-theme-copy=\"underworld\">THE FIRE HOLDS<span class=\"block text-[#f4d4