#007e92]\",\"children\":\"Each carries the mark of its trials.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"data-cstd-theme-copy\":\"astral\",\"children\":[\"Three journeys already travelled.\",[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"block text-[#007e92]\",\"children\":\"Each carries its choices and consequences.\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"border-l border-black/20 pl-6 text-sm leading-7 text-[#465156] md:text-base md:leading-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"data-cstd-theme-copy\":\"atelier\",\"children\":\"The homepage starts with outcomes: what shipped, why it was shaped that way, and where it runs now. The full teardown lives in the case archive.\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"data-cstd-theme-copy\":\"neon\",\"children\":\"The homepage starts with outcomes: what shipped, why it was shaped that way, and where it runs now. The full teardown lives in the case archive.\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"data-cstd-theme-copy\":\"underworld\",\"children\":\"Nothing leaves this forge untested. Each work keeps its outcome, decisive trade-off, and an inspectable record of how it was made.\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"data-cstd-theme-copy\":\"astral\",\"children\":\"These are not tales of inevitable victory. Each journey keeps the situation, the choice that was actually made, and the outcome you can still verify.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-cstd-proof-grid\":true,\"className\":\"mt-12 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:auto-rows-[15.5rem]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"article\",\"alpha-research-system\",{\"data-cstd-proof\":\"alpha\",\"className\":\"group relative min-h-[26rem] overflow-hidden border border-black/15 bg-[#050709] shadow-[0_18px_46px_rgba(5,7,9,0.1)] transition-transform duration-500 ease-out hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-7 lg:row-span-2 lg:min-h-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L24\",null,{\"src\":\"/cstd-projects/alpha.png\",\"alt\":\"CSTD Alpha research interface\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 1024px) 58vw, 100vw\",\"className\":\"object-cover tr