璃构成的产品界面铸造区\",\"en\":\"A black-glass product interface foundry\"}}},\"observatory\":{\"release\":\"CSTD-17.0\",\"freshness\":\"aging\",\"deployment\":{\"environment\":\"local\",\"shortCommit\":\"LOCAL\",\"sourceHref\":\"https://github.com/Muguett-DBY/RocoDex/tree/main\"},\"verification\":[{\"id\":\"unit-tests\",\"label\":\"单元与契约测试\",\"value\":245,\"unit\":\"tests\"},{\"id\":\"browser-tests\",\"label\":\"桌面与移动端验收\",\"value\":31,\"unit\":\"tests\"},{\"id\":\"static-output\",\"label\":\"静态生成页面\",\"value\":830,\"unit\":\"pages\"},{\"id\":\"initial-js\",\"label\":\"首页初始 JavaScript\",\"value\":180551,\"unit\":\"bytes\"}],\"content\":{\"score\":100,\"coverage\":{\"bilingualPercent\":100,\"topicPercent\":100,\"relationPercent\":100}},\"provenanceDigest\":\"fnv1a32:38091aac\"},\"locale\":\"en\"}]\n41:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(5,7,9,0.03)_0%,rgba(5,7,9,0.3)_46%,rgba(5,7,9,0.98)_82%)]\"}]\n42:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-5 md:p-7\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-[11px] font-black\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":[\"0\",1,\" / \",\"EVIDENCE PIPELINE / DECISION WORKSPACE\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"items-center gap-1.5 text-[#24e0ff] flex\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"iconNode\":[[\"path\",{\"d\":\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\",\"key\":\"oel41y\"}],[\"path\",{\"d\":\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\",\"key\":\"dzmm74\"}]],\"className\":\"lucide-shield-check h-3.5 w-3.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" \",80,\"%\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 font-semibold leading-tight text-white text-3xl md:text-5xl\",\"children\":\"CSTD Alpha research system\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\"