traceable, recoverable, and reviewable product workflows. Evidence: The private AI workbench and Alpha research system are independently deployed. A performance postmortem from a DCF scan: the hot path was repeated cache JSON handling, not the formula. A local three-scenario DCF screener that keeps data definitions, caching, run manifests, and Windows delivery in one research flow.\"}]\n53:[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/work/alpha-research-system\",\"aria-label\":\"Read source\",\"title\":\"Why does the DCF engine avoid model-generated calculations? / 3 linked nodes\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]\n54:[\"$\",\"article\",\"How do 1.47 million rows of open data become analysable?\",{\"data-cstd-knowledge-card\":true,\"className\":\"group grid gap-4 border-b border-white/14 py-7 md:grid-cols-[3rem_minmax(14rem,0.8fr)_minmax(0,1.2fr)_auto] md:items-center md:gap-7 lg:py-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"sr-only\",\"children\":\"SOURCE LINKED\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#f4d431]\",\"children\":[\"0\",4]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-2xl\",\"children\":\"How do 1.47 million rows of open data become analysable?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#9da8ab]\",\"children\":\"Three official City of Melbourne open datasets, cleaned, spatially joined, and modelled into one reproducible pipeline: 1.47 million pedestrian records meet the microclimate under a 150-metre matching rule. The FIT5147 exploration project: wrangling, spatially joining, and modelling Melbourne CBD pedestrian and microclimate data into a rerunnable pipeline.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/work/melbourne-pedestrian-microclimate\",\"aria-label\":\"Read source\",\"title\":\"How do 1.47 million rows of open data become analysable? / 2 linked nodes\",\"className\":\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center border border-white/15 text-[#24e0ff] transition-colors group-hover:border-[#24e0ff]/60 hover:bg-[#24e0ff] hover:text-[#050709]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"iconNode\":\"$0:data:0:rsc:props:children:0:0:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:4:props:children:1:props:children:2:props:iconNode\",\"className\":\"lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n21:0\n17:\"$undefined\"\n19:\"$undefined\"\n1c:\"$undefined\"\n1e:\"$undefined\"\n20:\"$undefined\"\n14:\"$undefined\"\n"}}